<section class="sec"><div class="wrap"><div class="tool-list" data-stagger><a class="trow rv" href="/claim-estimators/claim-gap-net-recovery-estimator/"><span class="ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/calculator.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/calculator-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/calculator.webp 957w" sizes="150px" width="957" height="638" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span>Δ</span></span><span class="tb"><span class="kind">Estimator</span><h2>Claim Gap Net-Recovery Estimator</h2><p>Measure the dispute, test where an award might land and subtract appraiser and umpire fees to see the net.</p><span class="more">Open</span></span></a><a class="trow rv" href="/claim-estimators/depreciation-holdback-splitter/"><span class="ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/paperwork.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/paperwork-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/paperwork.webp 960w" sizes="150px" width="960" height="640" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span>½</span></span><span class="tb"><span class="kind">Calculator</span><h2>Depreciation Holdback Splitter</h2><p>Split a replacement-cost claim into the first ACV check and the depreciation held back until repairs.</p><span class="more">Open</span></span></a><a class="trow rv" href="/claim-estimators/roof-area-pitch-converter/"><span class="ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/roof-shingles.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/roof-shingles-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/roof-shingles.webp 1200w" sizes="150px" width="1200" height="800" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span>◿</span></span><span class="tb"><span class="kind">Converter</span><h2>Roof Area &amp; Pitch Converter</h2><p>Turn a footprint and pitch into true roof squares, order quantity and a steep-charge check.</p><span class="more">Open</span></span></a><a class="trow rv" href="/claim-estimators/percentage-deductible-converter/"><span class="ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/hail-hand.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/hail-hand-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/hail-hand.webp 1080w" sizes="150px" width="1080" height="720" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span>%</span></span><span class="tb"><span class="kind">Converter</span><h2>Percentage Deductible Converter</h2><p>See a 1–10% wind/hail deductible in dollars and what a storm claim would actually pay.</p><span class="more">Open</span></span></a><a class="trow rv" href="/claim-estimators/claim-calendar-builder/"><span class="ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/clipboard.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/clipboard-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/clipboard.webp 960w" sizes="150px" width="960" height="640" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span>▦</span></span><span class="tb"><span class="kind">Planner</span><h2>Claim Calendar Builder</h2><p>Build a date-of-loss timeline for notice, repairs, proof of loss, holdback and suit dates, then export .ics.</p><span class="more">Open</span></span></a><a class="trow rv" href="/claim-estimators/appraisal-file-checkup/"><span class="ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/roofer.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/roofer-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/roofer.webp 960w" sizes="150px" width="960" height="640" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span>✓</span></span><span class="tb"><span class="kind">Checklist</span><h2>Appraisal File Checkup</h2><p>Twelve yes/no questions that score your claim file and build a to-do list before you demand appraisal.</p><span class="more">Open</span></span></a><a class="trow rv" href="/claim-estimators/wildfire-contents-inventory-estimator/"><span class="ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/wildfire-night.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/wildfire-night-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/wildfire-night.webp 1200w" sizes="150px" width="1200" height="800" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span>▤</span></span><span class="tb"><span class="kind">Estimator</span><h2>Wildfire Contents Inventory Estimator</h2><p>Rough out a room-by-room personal property inventory and compare it with your Coverage C limit.</p><span class="more">Open</span></span></a></div></div></section>
<section class="sec sec-white"><div class="wrap split top"><div class="rv-l"><span class="kicker">Suggested order</span><h2>Using the estimators together</h2><ol>
<li>Map your dates first with the <a href="/claim-estimators/claim-calendar-builder/">claim calendar builder</a>.</li>
<li>Check roof measurements with the <a href="/claim-estimators/roof-area-pitch-converter/">roof area &amp; pitch converter</a>.</li>
<li>See what you’re owed with the <a href="/claim-estimators/percentage-deductible-converter/">deductible</a> and <a href="/claim-estimators/depreciation-holdback-splitter/">depreciation</a> tools.</li>
<li>After a wildfire, start the <a href="/claim-estimators/wildfire-contents-inventory-estimator/">contents inventory estimator</a>.</li>
<li>Test the dispute in the <a href="/claim-estimators/claim-gap-net-recovery-estimator/">net-recovery estimator</a>, then run the <a href="/claim-estimators/appraisal-file-checkup/">file checkup</a>.</li></ol></div><div class="rv-r"><div class="box call"><h2 class="box-t">Talk it through first</h2><p>The first conversation is free. If appraisal isn’t the right tool, we’ll say so.</p><a class="big" href="tel:+18445371427">+1 (844) 537-1427</a><a class="btn gold" href="/contact-new-mexico-appraiser/">Send claim details</a></div></div></div></section>
